{"id":"29c11c38a35d8c1d","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-prop-hierarchy.md","title":"Hierarchy Properties","display":"prop-hierarchy — Hierarchy Properties","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-hierarchy","aliases":["58-prop-hierarchy"],"display":"prop-hierarchy — Hierarchy Properties","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-hierarchy — Hierarchy Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"19e9a8c33d5c841c\" href=\"?note=19e9a8c33d5c841c\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md\">../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\)</span> (ordinals, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha,V_\\beta\">\\(V_\\alpha,V_\\beta\\)</span> (canonical cumulative-hierarchy levels from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"19e9a8c33d5c841c\" href=\"?note=19e9a8c33d5c841c\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md\">../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}hierarchy} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\alpha\\leq\\beta\\to V_\\alpha\\subseteq V_\\beta\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}hierarchy} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\alpha\\leq\\beta\\to V_\\alpha\\subseteq V_\\beta\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical cumulative hierarchy is increasing: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_0 \\subseteq V_1 \\subseteq V_2 \\subseteq \\cdots\">\\(V_0 \\subseteq V_1 \\subseteq V_2 \\subseteq \\cdots\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Transitivity of each level is a separate induction consequence and is not silently bundled into this monotonicity statement.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md","status":"resolved","id":"19e9a8c33d5c841c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta$ (ordinals, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md","status":"resolved","id":"19e9a8c33d5c841c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$V_\\alpha,V_\\beta$ (canonical cumulative-hierarchy levels from [[../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\alpha,V_\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}hierarchy} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\alpha\\leq\\beta\\to V_\\alpha\\subseteq V_\\beta","display":true},{"tex":"V_0 \\subseteq V_1 \\subseteq V_2 \\subseteq \\cdots","display":false}],"bytes":953,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3965","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-prop-hierarchy.md|58-prop-hierarchy]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["19e9a8c33d5c841c","5582a281f15a33c2"]}